UPDATE companies SET description='Crown Automotive LLC operates from Bloomington, Minnesota, supplying automotive dealerships with a broad range of original-equipment and replacement parts. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

The business stocks thousands of fast-moving OEM part numbers and fulfills special orders for less common items. In addition to parts distribution, Crown Automotive provides custom packaging and arranges fast, free shipping on orders. When a part is not in stock, the company sources it through its supplier network.

The company positions itself as a dedicated dealership supplier, emphasizing deeper discounts than traditional channels.

Crown Automotive differentiates itself through what it calls "The Crown Way" – a commitment to unrivaled customer service, willingness to source hard-to-find parts, and a focus on saving dealerships money on every order.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Automotive parts distribution", "Special order sourcing", "Custom packaging", "Fast shipping"], "industries": ["Automotive dealerships", "Automotive aftermarket"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Deeper discounts on OEM and replacement parts", "Unrivaled customer service with a \"go the extra mile\" approach", "Willingness to source non-stocked parts through supplier network", "Custom packaging and fast, free shipping on orders"], "facts_used": ["Company name: Crown Automotive LLC -> db", "Headquarters: Bloomington, Minnesota -> db", "Business model: Distributes OEM and replacement automotive parts to dealerships -> /", "Services: Custom packaging, fast and free shipping, special order sourcing -> /", "Website: crown-parts.com -> db"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Crown Automotive, LLC offers 1,000''s of fast-moving OEM, highest-quality replacement, and special-order part #''s that will save your dealership money when purchased through us.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='crown-automotive-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Crown Metal Manufacturing Co. is based in Elmhurst, Illinois, and was founded in 1948 as a tool and die company. The business soon shifted to direct sales and developed a product line for store fixtures, working with early discounters in the retail sector.

The company specializes in custom metal fabrication of clothing display racks, store display fixtures, wire racks, wire shelving, shelf standards, wall standards, and shelf brackets. Its in-house capabilities include stamping (conventional and CNC turret punch press), roll forming, laser cutting, welding (resistance, brazing, robotic TIG and MIG), press brake forming (mechanical and CNC hydraulic), riveting, assembly, custom labeling, and custom packaging. Production takes place in a 200,000-square-foot single-story facility on a ten-acre site in Elmhurst, supplemented by a 40,000-square-foot warehouse in California.

Crown Metal serves fashion retail, grocery, mass retail, brand, industry supplier, backroom, and domestic manufacturing segments. It counts five of the top ten U.S. retailers among its customers and supplies a broad cross-section of value-oriented retailers, high-end department stores, and overseas buyers.

