UPDATE companies SET description='D & D Medical Equipment operates from Cabot, Arkansas, as a privately held distributor of medical equipment and supplies. The company does not disclose its founding year or the names of its founders in its public materials, describing itself only as a privately held company seeking to become the highest quality provider of a full line of medical equipment and supplies.

The firm sells and rents a full line of medical equipment directly to residential care settings. Its product range covers rehabilitation equipment, oxygen and respiratory devices, support surfaces, and a variety of other supplies. No facility size, headcount, or volume metrics are published, and the company does not list specific manufacturing processes or equipment.

Primary customers include assisted living facilities and nursing facilities.

D & D Medical states its mission is to be the quality and service leader in medical equipment sales and rental. It emphasizes compliance with local, state, and federal regulations, and highlights personalized service delivered by a dedicated staff as a key differentiator. The company asserts that its flexibility and responsiveness enable it to exceed customer expectations.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Medical equipment sales", "Medical equipment rental", "Rehabilitation equipment supply", "Oxygen and respiratory equipment supply", "Support surfaces supply", "Medical supplies distribution"], "industries": ["Assisted living facilities", "Nursing facilities", "Residential healthcare", "Medical equipment and supplies"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Mission to be quality and service leader in medical equipment sales and rental", "Personalized service through dedicated staff", "Compliance with local, state, and federal regulations", "Flexibility and responsiveness to customer needs", "Diverse choice of quality products and services"], "facts_used": ["Privately held company -> /about-us", "Headquartered in Cabot, Arkansas -> db", "Sells and rents medical equipment and supplies -> /", "Serves assisted living facilities and nursing facilities -> /", "Provides rehabilitation equipment, oxygen and respiratory equipment, support surfaces -> /", "Mission to be Quality Leader and Service Leader in medical equipment sales & rental -> /about-us", "Committed to superior personalized service through dedicated staff -> /about-us", "Upholds industry standards, complies with local, state, federal regulations -> /about-us", "Emphasizes flexibility and responsiveness -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "D&D Medical sells and rents medical equipment and supplies directly to residential living settings such as assisted living fac