ve 30+ years experience -> /", "Services: Design for Manufacturability, SolidWorks design assistance, prototypes, production, value-added assembly -> /", "Equipment: Amada ENSIS 3015 AJ fiber laser with automation, Amada AE2510NT turret punch, Amada HG 8025 and HD 8025 NT press brakes, Timesaver 37-inch wet machine, Haeger 618-1L and Auto-Sert AS-7 hardware insertion presses, Scotchman cold saw, Acer NC mill, LeBlond lathe, Miller MIG/TIG welders (3 booths), 26 ft International straight truck -> /", "Quality: ISO 9001:2015 implemented -> /", "ERP: Mie-Trak Pro for live data collection -> /", "Facility: air-conditioned shop, cafeteria, lockers, security -> /", "Testimonial: industrial hand sanitizer dispenser project with multiple prototype iterations -> /", "Certification: ISO 9001 (from database) -> db", "Capabilities from database: Mie-Trak Pro live data -> db"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "precision sheet metal fabrication job shops", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='dynamic-sheetmetal-fabrication-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
