UPDATE companies SET description='E-TekNet Inc. operates from its U.S. headquarters in Gilbert, Arizona, serving as the domestic face of a business that fully owns its printed circuit board (PCB) and printed circuit board assembly (PCBA) factories in China.

The company manufactures bare PCBs and fully assembled PCBAs, offering quick-turn services with lead times as short as two days for bare boards. Its capabilities span PCB fabrication, turnkey assembly (including component procurement, stencil creation, and box-build), conformal coating, solder stencil production, reverse engineering from sample boards, and functional testing. E-TekNet handles orders ranging from prototypes to medium and large production volumes.

Customers include electronics firms such as Zenem Corp., Sanker International Inc., Sable Systems International, and Coleman Air Inc., reflecting a client base that values rapid quoting, on-time delivery, and technical support.

E-TekNet differentiates itself by owning 100% of its manufacturing facilities in China while maintaining a U.S. headquarters, a model it says eliminates middlemen and ensures direct quality control. The founders cite past experiences with unreliable suppliers as the motivation for a service built on trust, reliability, and a one-stop-shop approach that aims to save customers time and money.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','UL','RoHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Bare PCB fabrication", "PCB assembly (SMT/THT)", "Turnkey PCB assembly (components, stencil, fabrication)", "Box-build assembly", "Solder stencil manufacturing", "Conformal coating", "Reverse engineering (PCB to CAM/BOM)", "PCB design assistance", "Component procurement", "Functional testing", "Quick-turn prototyping (2-day bare PCB)", "Online quoting and ordering", "Multilingual customer support (English, Spanish)"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Prototype to medium and large-scale volumes", "lead_time": "As short as 2 days for bare PCB; quick-turn assembly", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["100% company-owned PCB and PCBA facilities in China", "U.S.-based headquarters with direct engineering support", "Quick-turn bare PCB in as little as two days", "Turnkey 4-in-1 service: bare board, stencil, components, assembly", "Live support in English and Spanish"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters address: 219 S William Dillard Dr., STE 141, Gilbert, AZ 85233 -> /", "Company description: manufactures bare PCBs and PCBAs, quick-turn, prototypes to large volumes -> db", "Ownership model: 100% owned PCB/PCBA fabs in China -> /", "Certifications: ISO9001, UL, RoHS -> /, db", "Capabilities: bare PCB, PCB assembly, turnkey, box-build, conformal coating, solder stencil, reverse engineering, PCB design partners, parts procurement, functional test -> /", "Lead time: as short as two days for bare PCB -> /", "Volume range: prototypes to medium and large-scale volumes -> /", "Customer exam