UPDATE companies SET description='EDGE Energy is headquartered in Beltsville, Maryland, and was founded in 2006 by Jason Dispenza, who serves as Founder and CEO. The company began as a mission-driven contractor focused on helping homeowners across the Maryland, Washington, D.C., and Virginia region reduce energy costs and transition to renewable energy.

