UPDATE companies SET description='EVCO Plastics operates a manufacturing facility in Calhoun, Georgia, known as CAL1. The site is part of EVCO Plastics, a company specializing in custom plastic injection molding.

The Calhoun plant spans 110,000 square feet and houses 17 injection molding machines with clamping forces up to 3,300 tons. The facility offers a range of molding processes including plastic injection molding, gas assist molding, multi-shot molding, insert molding, overmolding, in-mold decorating and labeling, liquid silicone rubber molding, and stack molding. Tool and mold building, design for manufacturability, scientific injection molding, metrology, and robotics automation support the production workflow.

The facility serves medical and healthcare, consumer products, industrial products, and plastic packaging sectors. Medical device manufacturers are among its customers, with the company highlighting early supplier involvement and metal-to-plastic conversion expertise for healthcare applications.

EVCO Plastics emphasizes early collaboration in the product development lifecycle, providing engineering services, material selection guidance, and prototyping to help partners achieve competitive advantages. The Calhoun location maintains ISO 9001 certification with design scope and operates an ISO Class 8 clean room for sensitive molding applications.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Plastic Injection Molding", "Gas Assist Molding", "Multi-Shot Molding", "Insert Molding", "Overmolding", "In-Mold Decorating/Labeling (IML)", "Molded-In Color", "Liquid Silicone Rubber (LSR) Molding", "Stack Molding", "Tool and Mold Building", "Large Part Molding", "Metal to Plastic Conversion", "Contract Manufacturing", "Plastic Packaging", "Prototyping", "Engineering Services", "Design for Manufacturability", "Material Selection", "Scientific Injection Molding", "Metrology", "Robotics & Automation", "Early Supplier Involvement", "Thin Wall Packaging", "ISO Class 8 Clean Room Molding"], "industries": ["Medical & Healthcare", "Consumer Products", "Industrial Products", "Plastic Packaging", "Medical Device Manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Injection molding machines (28\u20134,400 ton range)", "17 injection molding machines (up to 3,300 tons) at Calhoun facility", "ISO Class 8 clean room"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["110,000 sq ft facility with 17 injection molding machines up to 3,300 tons", "Early supplier involvement and design for manufacturability support", "Scientific injection molding and in-house metrology", "ISO Class 8 clean room for medical molding"], "facts_used": ["Location: Calhoun, Georgia -> db (hq_city, hq_state_label)", "Facility size: 110,000 sq ft -> / (page content)", "Machine count: 17 injection molding machines -> /", "Machine tonnage: up to 3,300 tons -> /", "Certification: ISO 9001 with design -> /", "Capabilities: plastic injection molding, gas assist, multi-shot, insert molding, o