UPDATE companies SET description='Eben Blaney Fine Contemporary Furniture operates from a studio and showroom in Edgecomb, Maine.

The company creates contemporary furniture and decor including tables, seating, case pieces, beds, mirrors, and decorative objects. Every item is handmade using carefully selected hardwoods, with an emphasis on precise joinery and imaginative engineering. Blaney constructs pieces one at a time or in limited production runs, and each finished work is signed, dated, and numbered if part of a series.

Clients include individual homeowners, interior designers, architects, and collectors across the Northeast, nationally, and internationally. The studio serves both retail customers and trade professionals, and a selection of pieces is also available through the online platform Incollect. Custom commissions are accepted through a defined process that begins with a consultation.

Blaney''s work is distinguished by bold, clean-lined forms that are deceptively complex, requiring exacting craftsmanship to achieve animated, dynamic stances and smooth functionality. The business was founded on a commitment to the highest artistic and functional standards, with every piece impeccably handmade from the most beautiful hardwoods.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Contemporary Furniture", "Limited Production Furniture", "Case Pieces", "Mirrors and Decor", "Custom Furniture Commission", "Handcrafted Joinery"], "industries": ["Residential Furniture", "Interior Design", "Luxury Home Furnishings", "Art Collectors", "Trade Professionals"], "materials": ["Hardwoods"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Handmade one at a time or in small batches", "Each piece signed, dated, and numbered", "Custom commission process for one-of-a-kind designs", "Limited production runs of original designs", "Showroom and studio in Edgecomb, Maine"], "facts_used": ["Company name and description -> db", "Location: Edgecomb, Maine -> db", "Founder: Eben Blaney -> /", "Over 20 years experience -> /", "Products: contemporary furniture and decor (tables, seating, case pieces, beds, mirrors, decor) -> /", "Process: handmade, precise joinery, small batches, signed/dated/numbered -> /", "Customers: individual clients, design professionals, trade members, national/international -> /", "Showroom at 96 Eddy Road, Edgecomb, Maine -> /", "Available on Incollect platform -> /", "Materials: carefully selected hardwoods -> /", "Custom commission process -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Distinctive, handmade contemporary furniture and decor, designed and finely crafted in Maine by Eben Blaney.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=n